":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"S256"},{"text":", mandatory strong client authentication, mandatory sender-constrained tokens,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and a refusal of every relaxation the base specs permit. Encoding them as one profile rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than a dozen independent booleans means an operator cannot register a client that is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"nearly"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" FAPI, and a reviewer can answer “is this client financial-grade?” by reading one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"field. The same philosophy as the rate-limit postures: ordinary clients see no behaviour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change at all, because "},{"identifier":"Self::Standard","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the serde default and every row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written before schema v38 decodes to it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ClientProfile","kind":"identifier"}]}}}